ved_by":null},{"id":572781997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw1NzI3ODE5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:audio","name":"topic:audio","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2025-07-13T17:05:05Z","updated_at":"2025-07-17T00:17:29Z","closed_at":"2025-07-13T20:15:49Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/108581","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108581","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108581.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108581.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"This pull request resolves an issue where the microphone input buffer could become desynchronized, resulting in a growing delay during audio capture and playback.\r\n\r\n## Summary of Changes\r\n\r\n- **Buffer Resynchronization:**\r\n  Added logic to detect when the playback offset (`input_ofs`) exceeds the available input buffer size (`input_size`). When this occurs, the playback offset is reset to the latest available data, preventing the delay from increasing indefinitely.\r\n- **Delay Prevention:**\r\n  If the calculated playback delay is greater than the available input size, the buffer is cleared and resynchronized, ensuring real-time audio input remains in sync.\r\n\r\n## Impact\r\n\r\n- Prevents the accumulation of audio delay when using microphone input.\r\n- Ensures consistent, real-time audio capture and playback for users.\r\n\r\n\r\nThis fixes #80173 ","closed_by":{"login":"lazydevl0per","id":126037837,"node_id":"U_kgDOB4MvTQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/126037837?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lazydevl0per","html_url":"https://github.com/lazydevl0per","